# BuildKit reads this file for web/Dockerfile instead of a .dockerignore at the
# root, so the build context rules live with the web layer and QuranText's own
# files stay untouched. Only what the image installs is sent.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!web/

**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
web/tests
